# ============================================================================
# Confidential DATA — never publish. These are real Brazilian company filings
# and everything generated from them. The repo ships CODE + CONFIG only; bring
# your own OCR JSON to run it.
# ============================================================================

# All JSON (sample inputs, structured outputs, quality reports, baselines)...
*.json
# ...EXCEPT the SBS field->alias mapping, which is required CONFIG the app loads
# at runtime (structure_ocr / sbs_labeler read it via __file__). Keep it tracked.
!sbs_label_mapping.json

# All Excel (generated reports + the source SBS-fields workbook + Office locks)
*.xlsx
~$*.xlsx

# Images — screenshots may show confidential financial tables. None are needed
# by the tool; force-add a specific asset (e.g. a logo) with `git add -f` if ever required.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg

# ============================================================================
# Internal / local — not part of the shippable tool
# ============================================================================

# R&D scratch (benchmarks, baselines, experiments)
sbs_redesign/

# Local Claude Code settings (settings.local.json)
.claude/

# One-off snapshot helper tied to local data
_baseline_snapshot.py

# ============================================================================
# Python
# ============================================================================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ============================================================================
# Editor / OS
# ============================================================================
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
